{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54149","headline":"野庙碑附诗 · 陆龟蒙","name":"野庙碑附诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"土木其形，窃吾民之酒牲，固无以名。\n土木其智，窃吾君之禄位，如何可议。\n禄位颀颀，酒牲甚微，神之飨也，孰云其非。\n视吾之碑，知斯文之孔碑。\n（见《甫里先生文集》卷十八、《唐文粹》卷五二）（按：《全唐诗》卷六一九收《纪梦游甘露寺》第十四句缺三字。\n今检《四库全书》本《甫里集》卷四，此句作「嘹哓余韵𠲜」\n诗甚长，不重录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54149.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54149","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}